{"id": "34559", "title": "春风薰人醉", "author": "岑扬", "category": "文学名著", "count": 39, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34559.htm", "intro": "欸欸欸！一个姑娘家镇日喝得酩酊大醉的，这像话吗？瞧她没一刻清醒的，竟还想当他聚酒庄大当家的护卫咧！这简直是───好吧好吧，就算她醉拳醉剑耍得了得，那又如何？好歹她是个姑娘家，而他可是个昂藏男子啊！怎能……唉！好无力啊！瞧她巴着他不放的蠢模样……想他顶着「天下第一醇」的御赐牌匾，谁人不惧他来着？唯有这醉丫头了……她非但不怕他，还成天将她对他的企图挂在嘴边嚷，不是琼玉醉、仙翁饮，就是芙蓉醉、塞下曲的，难道她满心满眼就只看得见他的酒库，而无一丁点他的……人吗？唉！头痛！真个儿教人头痛的醉丫头！他得好好想个法子转移她的兴头了……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34559", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2191564.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2191565.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2191566.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2191567.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2191568.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2191569.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2191570.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2191571.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2191572.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2191573.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2191574.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2191575.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2191576.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2191577.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2191578.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2191579.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2191580.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2191581.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2191582.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2191583.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2191584.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2191585.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2191586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2191587.html", "available": false